------------------------------------------------------------------------------
mira-mode-control (miramode)
https://github.com/ryan-shaw/mira-mode-control
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ryan Shaw reverse engineered the Bluetooth LE protocol of current-generation
Mira Mode valves (GATT service 267f0001-eb15-43f5-94c3-67d2221188f7) and
published it as the miramode Python library. This integration's protocol
module ports that library's frame format, checksum, opcodes, state layout and
frame reassembly, and its tests reuse replies the library's author recorded
from real hardware. Without that work this integration would not exist.

